 "note": "Which flag calls the formation scripts of our FFX chapters make, and with which constant, in code order; and, for the whole game, which formation files make each flag call (FFX-G06 sections 4.1 and 4.2: the constant argument pushed just before the call). Derived from the install's own formation files by a static scan; no script text. `reset` is the value the battle set-up (FFX.exe VA 0x00781020) writes before the formation script runs; `setters` is how each call stores its argument (emulated, FFX-G06 section 4.2: a byte keeps the low 8 bits, a bit keeps the lowest bit). Regenerate with the scripts kept in D:/Tools/ffx-parity/rc10/ffx-formation-flags (extract-writes.mjs, then make-fixture.mjs; the folder constant T inside both names the lane's old temp folder, point it at a scratch folder); not part of the build.",
